COMMENT ON TABLE public."Feature04_Technical_Indicator" IS '55-column daily technical Feature04: unchanged TA-Lib v1/v2 formulas plus Pine SMI14/5/5 ±40 and post-bar swing state. v3 BBCA only initially; other tickers retain v2 and NULL new columns. Closed-bar trigger INTEGER 1/0; no historical backdating, scheduler or TradingView-export parity claim.';
