, so a lowered newly confirmed level can contribute to a trigger. No one-shot lock or SMI-at-break filter; repeated triggers are possible. Not a trade instruction or win probability.','Filter value 1 and use trade_date as the closed Daily trigger date; SUM counts trigger bars among computed rows.','A wick alone does not trigger. Literal Pine compares changing current/prior levels, so a lowered newly confirmed level can contribute to a trigger. No one-shot lock or SMI-at-break filter; repeated triggers are possible. Not a trade instruction or win probability.','CALCULATION_VERIFIED',ARRAY['features/feature04/tests/test_swing.py','verification/feature04/SMI_BBCA.md','FEATURE04_COLUMN_DEFINITIONS.md','features/feature04/reference/HH.pine']::text[]);
